{% comment %}
  Animal for Animal Vision Section
{% endcomment %}

<section class="animal-vision-section">
  <div class="animal-vision-section__container">
    <div class="animal-vision-section__content">
      <h2 class="animal-vision-section__title">Our Vision</h2>

      <div class="animal-vision-section__text">
        <p class="animal-vision-section__paragraph">
          Our vision is to create a unique and self-sustainable organization that doesn't rely on donations to thrive.
          Instead, we aim to support ourselves through a portion of the proceeds generated by our brand, "Dear Me." Our
          primary goal is to make a positive impact on the lives of our fellow animals and bridge the gap that separates
          us from them.
        </p>

        <p class="animal-vision-section__paragraph">
          Our mission extends beyond eliminating the exploitation that animals endure at the hands of humans. We are
          committed to educating younger generations about the importance of caring for and showing compassion towards
          animals. By instilling these values at a young age, we hope to mold them into better, more compassionate
          adults who will carry our mission forward into the future.
        </p>

        <p class="animal-vision-section__paragraph animal-vision-section__paragraph--highlight">
          Our ultimate aim is to foster a world where humans and animals coexist harmoniously, free from exploitation
          and discrimination. ❤️
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .animal-vision-section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    position: relative;
    background: #fef9f2 url('{{ 'noise.png' | asset_url }}');
    background-size: 150px 150px;
    background-repeat: repeat;
  }

  .animal-vision-section__container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 4rem;
  }

  .animal-vision-section__content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .animal-vision-section__title {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    color: #63001f;
    text-transform: none;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .animal-vision-section__text {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .animal-vision-section__paragraph {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
    color: #63001f;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .animal-vision-section__paragraph--highlight {
    width: 90%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: italic;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #aa336a, #aa336a);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  /* Mobile responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .animal-vision-section {
      padding: 4rem 0;
    }

    .animal-vision-section__container {
      padding: 0 2rem;
    }

    .animal-vision-section__title {
      font-size: 2.5rem !important;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .animal-vision-section__paragraph {
      font-size: 1.1rem !important;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .animal-vision-section__container {
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }

    .animal-vision-section__title {
      font-size: 2rem !important;
    }

    .animal-vision-section__paragraph {
      font-size: 1rem !important;
    }
  }
</style>
